# Cursor Rules for VinFast EV Platform

You are an expert full-stack engineer specialized in Next.js 16 (App Router), TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS v4.

## General Principles
- Use TypeScript with strict typing. Never introduce `any` types.
- Follow lean Next.js App Router patterns. Import domain types from `@/types` and mock data from `@/data`.
- Keep the Dashboard strictly in **Dark Mode (`#1f1f1f`)**.
- Keep Landing Page dual-themeable (`ThemeProvider`) with bilingual support (`LanguageProvider`).
- Ensure all new client components start with `"use client";`.
- Always verify code by checking `npx tsc --noEmit`.
